{
  "id": "p08",
  "title": "The Old Tower",
  "titleZh": "老塔保卫战",
  "topic": "乡村与守护",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "This small country changed a great deal in the last century.",
        "zh": "这个小小的国家在上个世纪发生了很大变化。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old stone tower sits quietly on a soft green hill.",
        "zh": "那座古老的石塔静静地立在柔和的绿丘上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The quiet countryside is far from the busy capital.",
        "zh": "安静的乡间离繁忙的首都很远。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Coal and oil made the little company very rich indeed.",
        "zh": "煤和石油让这家小公司变得非常富有。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My village leader is also a very busy doctor.",
        "zh": "我们村的领头人也是一位非常忙碌的医生。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The company does not allow us to raise much money at all.",
        "zh": "公司完全不允许我们筹集太多钱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The company wants control and a new, strict, unfair rule.",
        "zh": "公司想要控制权，还想立一条严苛而不公平的新规矩。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We act against the plan with one clear, calm, steady voice.",
        "zh": "我们用同一个清晰、平静、沉稳的声音反对这个计划。"
      },
      {
        "en": "That single kind word gave the whole village new hope.",
        "zh": "那一个善意的词给了整个村子新的希望。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then ten free seats wait in the front row today.",
        "zh": "于是，今天前排还空着十个免费座位。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A weekend walk is good exercise for all of us together.",
        "zh": "周末散步对我们所有人一起来说都是很好的锻炼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the day, we fill the old hall well before dark.",
        "zh": "白天，我们早早把旧礼堂装满，赶在天黑前完成。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A traditional flag hangs above the old wooden door.",
        "zh": "一面传统的旗子挂在旧木门上方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Trust builds a strong relation between two quiet neighbours.",
        "zh": "信任在两位安静的邻居之间建立起牢固的关系。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My first task is hard to achieve this busy year.",
        "zh": "我的第一项任务在这个忙碌的年份里很难完成。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Anyway, we will not waste this rare, precious chance.",
        "zh": "不管怎样，我们不会浪费这次难得而宝贵的机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A loud fan blows smoke away from the crowd.",
        "zh": "一台响亮的扇子把烟从人群那边吹开。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sad joke can still make us all smile together.",
        "zh": "一个悲伤的笑话仍能让我们大家一起笑起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we pick up old tools and repair the stone wall.",
        "zh": "然后我们拿起旧工具，修补石墙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A cotton bag holds together every old stamp we found last week.",
        "zh": "一个棉布袋把我们上周找到的每一枚旧邮票收在一起。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "She gives the pink flower a quick, gentle kiss.",
        "zh": "她给那朵粉色的花一个轻快温柔的吻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The cold morning temperature barely rises before warm, bright noon.",
        "zh": "寒冷的清晨气温在温暖明亮的正午前几乎没有上升。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The killing cold tries to steal their last, fragile hope.",
        "zh": "刺骨的严寒试图夺走他们最后、最脆弱的希望。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We get only one chance to save it here and now today.",
        "zh": "我们现在在这里只得到一次救它的机会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My own two hands can rebuild our old wall.",
        "zh": "我自己的双手就能重建我们那堵旧墙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We ask them to sign the order this warm afternoon.",
        "zh": "我们请他们今天下午签这份命令。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An international group helps us feed the hungry winter birds.",
        "zh": "一个国际团体帮我们喂养饥饿的冬鸟。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later, somewhere, a small victory helps us succeed.",
        "zh": "后来，在某个地方，一场小小的胜利帮我们最终成功。"
      }
    ]
  ],
